{
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "l01",
   "text": "You have never seen your own face.",
   "file": "l01.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "l02",
   "text": "Not once.",
   "file": "l02.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "l03",
   "text": "Every mirror you've ever looked into flipped it,",
   "file": "l03.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "l04",
   "text": "so the face you know is backwards.",
   "file": "l04.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "l05",
   "text": "Photos don't help either.",
   "file": "l05.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "l06",
   "text": "Held at arm's length, a phone lens can make your nose look about thirty percent wider.",
   "file": "l06.wav",
   "take_score": 0.903
  },
  {
   "id": "l07",
   "text": "You see, your brain loves the version it sees the most.",
   "file": "l07.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "l08",
   "text": "In 1977, researchers showed people two photos of themselves.",
   "file": "l08.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "l09",
   "text": "The real one, and a mirrored one.",
   "file": "l09.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "l10",
   "text": "They picked the mirrored one.",
   "file": "l10.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "l11",
   "text": "Their friends picked the real one.",
   "file": "l11.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "l12",
   "text": "That's why your photos look wrong to you.",
   "file": "l12.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "l13",
   "text": "They're the face everyone else gets.",
   "file": "l13.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "l14",
   "text": "The closest you'll ever come is the tip of your nose.",
   "file": "l14.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "l15",
   "text": "It's in everything you look at.",
   "file": "l15.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "l16",
   "text": "Your brain just deletes it.",
   "file": "l16.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "l17",
   "text": "Which means, technically, you have never seen your own face.",
   "file": "l17.wav",
   "take_score": 1.0
  }
 ]
}